issue_context.body:
**Describe the bug**
When building a project with the SSD1306 enabled and set up, I get this output:

**To Reproduce**
Steps to reproduce the behavior:
1 - add `CONFIG_SSD1306=y` to prj.conf
2- add `arduino headers` and `arduino_I2C` to `esp32.dts`
```
`{
	 arduino_header: connector {
		 compatible = "arduino-header-r3";
		 #gpio-cells = <2>;
		 gpio-map-mask = <0xffffffff 0xffffffc0>;
		 gpio-map-pass-thru = <0 0x3f>;
		 gpio-map = <0 0 &gpio0 4 0>,	/* A0 */
				<1 0 &gpio0 0 0>,	/* A1 */
				<2 0 &gpio0 2 0>,	/* A2 */
				<3 0 &gpio0 15 0>,	/* A3 */
				///////////I2C///////////
				<4 0 &gpio0 13 0>,	/* A4 */
				<5 0 &gpio0 12 0>,	/* A5 */
				<6 0 &gpio0 1 0>,	/* D0 */
				<7 0 &gpio0 3 0>,	/* D1 */
				///////////////SPI/////////////////
				<8 0 &gpio0 18 0>,	/* D10 */
				<9 0 &gpio0 27 0>,	/* D11 */
				<10 0 &gpio0 19 0>,	/* D12 */
				<11 0 &gpio0 5 0>;	/* D13 */
				/////////////////////////////////			   
	 };
 };
 
 arduino_i2c: &i2c0 {
	 status = "okay";
	 clock-frequency = <I2C_BITRATE_FAST>;
	 sda-pin = <4>;
	 scl-pin = <15>;
 };
 ////////////////////////////////////////////////////////`
```
2-Build using west build -b esp32 samples\display\cfb -- -DSHIELD=ssd1306_128x64

**Expected behavior**
display a message on oled display 

**output**
```
`
▒*** Booting Zephyr OS version 2.5.99  ***source...
Device not found
[00:00:00.437,000] <err> ssd1306: Failed to initialize device!

`
```



**Environment (please complete the following information):**
 OS: Windows
Toolchain Zephyr SDK
